- KTextEditor
  https://invent.kde.org/frameworks/ktexteditor
  Pinned tag: v6.31.0
  License: LGPL-2.0-or-later and LGPL-2.0-only.
  See the SPDX headers in upstream/ktexteditor.

- KSyntaxHighlighting
  https://invent.kde.org/frameworks/syntax-highlighting
  Pinned tag: v6.31.0
  License: the library and the themes are MIT. The syntax definitions use
  several licenses. See the license attribute in each definition file.

The KDE contributors wrote those works. Their names are in the
SPDX-FileCopyrightText lines of the upstream trees and in the upstream
commit history. The pinned trees do not contain an AUTHORS file. See AUTHORS
in this repository.

The Rust source in this repository is not a copy of the KDE source. The
study of that source is recorded in docs/design/06-licensing.md.

